Country outlines: drawn in marker from open boundary data johan/world.geo.json (public domain), dissolved and simplified
(scenes/geo.py). «карта Меркатора» = Web-Mercator; «истинный размер» = Lambert azimuthal equal-area, one scale for both
shapes (Africa / Greenland area as drawn: 13.8, the narration's «в четырнадцать раз»). The great circle on the Atlantic
chart is computed (slerp) and projected; the rhumb line is the straight Mercator segment between the same two points.

